    {
      "title": "Alpha Patch Notes \u2013 v0.2.7",
      "date": "2025-06-18 09:56:33",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1802893906697691",
      "content": "[b]Gameplay[/b]\n-Adjusted overall difficulty balance for a more consistent challenge curve\n\n[b]UX/UI[/b]\n-Added enemy health bar display to enhance combat readability\n-Implemented new UX elements to support clarity and player feedback\n\n[b]Achievements[/b]\n-Added a new unlockable achievement tied to exploration and progression\n\n[b]Bug Fixes[/b]\n-Fixed minor bugs affecting visual feedback and interaction cues\n\n",
      "key": "3637800::6614ee06ed8c0b0f7cf1a3a2c7d454593cb299d1",
      "tags": null
    },
    {
      "title": "Alpha Patch Notes \u2013 v0.2.6",
      "date": "2025-06-05 12:04:15",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1801617199396277",
      "content": "[b]Gameplay[/b]\n-Added a new stage expanding narrative scope and progression possibilities\n-Introduced a soul system that alters gameplay loops based on player state\n-Implemented a mechanic to suppress soul effects, enabling alternative strategies\n-Rebalanced difficulty curve to improve pacing and challenge consistency\n\n[b]Cutscenes[/b]\n-Added new cutscenes tied to progression and soul mechanics\n-Fixed inconsistencies in cutscene playback under specific conditions\n\n[b]Audio[/b]\n-Introduced a dynamic background music system reacting to proximity\n-Improved mix and spatialization of ambient audio and voice layers\n\n[b]Animation[/b]\n-Polished several animation cycles for player and scripted sequences\n-Resolved animation syncing issues during transitions and cutscenes\n\n[b]Performance[/b]\n-Split certain large environments into separate phases to improve performance on lower-end hardware\n\n[b]UI/UX[/b]\n-Added contextual tips to guide players through new mechanics\n\n[b]Bug Fixes[/b]\n-Fixed rare damage spikes and unexpected player deaths in specific scenarios",
      "key": "3637800::c212a0afed257da850a7ee0641a4bd5907fdd1a2",
      "tags": null
    },
    {
      "title": "Alpha Patch v0.2.5(1)",
