      "title": "Alpha Patch Notes \u2013 v0.2.5",
      "date": "2025-05-26 13:06:52",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1800357164540943",
      "content": "Gameplay\n   -Reworked the introductory gameplay flow to improve pacing and narrative clarity\n   -Added new contextual animations to enhance immersion during key scenes\n\nAudio\n   -Fixed spatial 3D audio inaccuracies in both indoor and outdoor environments\n   -Improved positional sound effects for ambient and dynamic elements\n\nAnimation\n   -Refined animation transitions\n   -Fixed animation glitches during certain cutscenes\n\nPerformance\n   -Optimized memory usage in complex scenes\n   -Improved stability on low-end systems",
      "key": "3637800::6133e539c7658a3ebb8a219d430ded59e59780bf",
      "tags": null
    },
